# Keep the build context small and deterministic. The Dockerfile ends with
# `COPY . /srv/`, so without this every cache in the backend tree is uploaded to
# the daemon and baked into the image -- .mypy_cache alone is ~140 MB, which is
# larger than the rest of the image put together and invalidates the COPY layer
# on every type-check run.
#
# Mirrors the repository .gitignore for the same paths. Nothing listed here is
# needed at run time; the ones that ARE (app/templates, scripts/) are
# deliberately absent from this file.
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*.so

.venv/
venv/

.mypy_cache/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.hypothesis/
.coverage
.coverage.*
coverage.xml
htmlcov/

*.log
.DS_Store
